S122's P6 variant (adocs/data/S122_screen.sh, DEC-344 (3)), never committed to src/: the
curve's attacker and incidence inputs counted over each king's zone and the rank in front
of it, the research pass's mask (adocs/data/S122_census_core.hpp zone_plus). The linear
five keep the zone; the curve's other inputs are unchanged. The zone and its forward rank
are up to 12 squares, so ks_curve_reach's incidences bound moves from 15 x 9 = 135 to
15 x 12 = 180 with it (S122's fast check, finding 8). Applies to S122's phase 1 landing;
regenerate from its src/evaluation.cpp if that moves.

